  "qid": "120",
  "tip": "<p>Map the requirement to the data protection objective. A need for zero data loss implies <i>synchronous</i> replication and a need for continuity implies <i>automatic failover</i>. Then confirm the exact engine requirement before choosing a service.</p>",
